  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.25 Residential real estate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.25 “Residential real estate” means the real estate which a person occupies as the person’s principal place of abode together with any appurtenant land or buildings, including manufactured housing if used for that purpose.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16 (from Rev 401.11); renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.24)",
